# Plan (/plan) and Practice (/practice) run on a local Ollama model —
# free, no API key, nothing here to set. Just have Ollama running:
#   ollama serve
#   ollama pull llama3.1:8b   (or any tool-calling-capable model)
# Override the defaults if needed:
# OLLAMA_BASE_URL=http://localhost:11434
# OLLAMA_MODEL=llama3.1:8b

# Required for live voice sparring (/spar) — real-time speech-to-speech.
# There's no free/local equivalent wired up for this yet; it uses OpenAI's
# Realtime API, which needs a paid key.
OPENAI_API_KEY=
# OPENAI_REALTIME_MODEL=gpt-realtime-2.1
# OPENAI_REALTIME_VOICE=marin
